      "file": "proof/draft-correction-while-invalid/answer-update-draft-from-the-drafts-own-record.md",
      "title": "Proof — update-draft answers from the draft's own stored record",
      "summary": "Integration tests against a real Postgres-backed store prove the manifest-empty-draft acceptance and write/answer shape criteria, and unit tests prove the controller's DTO-mapping and its acceptance of a glossary-absent submitted subject, while the pre-existing refusal/validation coverage was kept valid under the renamed readCaseVersion dependency.",
      "task": "task/draft-correction-while-invalid/answer-update-draft-from-the-drafts-own-record"
    },
    {
      "id": "proof/draft-correction-while-invalid/read-a-drafts-own-declared-attributes",
