      "title": "HTTP route serving a case version's own declared attributes -- proof",
      "summary": "Six tests over GET /v1/cases/:slug/versions/:version/declared-attributes, each an obligation this task states -- its six criteria and the four UNDERDETERMINED entries the binder named -- with the http-200 constraint node demonstrated whole by the test covering both representative calls its own fitness names.",
      "task": "task/draft-correction-while-invalid/serve-a-drafts-own-declared-attributes-over-http"
    },
    {
      "id": "proof/draft-discard-while-invalid/prove-discard-accepts-a-draft-failing-validation",
      "kind": "proof",
      "file": "proof/draft-discard-while-invalid/prove-discard-accepts-a-draft-failing-validation.md",
      "title": "Proof that discard accepts a draft failing validation",
      "summary": "Two new tests exercise the real discard route, controller and operation -- one against a real Postgres-backed store for a manifest-empty draft, one against a fake store standing in for the boundary a foreign key makes unreachable -- showing acceptance and a bodyless 204 for both a structural and a coherence validator failure, plus one pre-existing test cited for the no-content constraint it already fully decides.",
      "task": "task/draft-discard-while-invalid/prove-discard-accepts-a-draft-failing-validation"
    },
    {
      "id": "proof/draft-editor-correction-while-invalid/load-a-refused-drafts-own-record-into-the-editor-state",
      "kind": "proof",
      "file": "proof/draft-editor-correction-while-invalid/load-a-refused-drafts-own-record-into-the-editor-state.md",
      "title": "Proof for loading a refused draft's own record into the editor state",
      "summary": "Hook-level tests against the public useEditDraftVersionForm, exercised directly via renderHook with a minimal router context provider, covering all 19 criteria and the specification nodes a finite test can decide whole within this task's own implemented scope.",
      "task": "task/draft-editor-correction-while-invalid/load-a-refused-drafts-own-record-into-the-editor-state"
    },
    {
      "id": "proof/draft-editor-correction-while-invalid/route-the-manifest-screen-to-the-version-editor",
      "kind": "proof",
      "file": "proof/draft-editor-correction-while-invalid/route-the-manifest-screen-to-the-version-editor.md",
      "title": "Proof that the manifest screen routes to the version's editor on every reading",
      "summary": "One test walks the manifest screen through all five readings its four phases distinguish -- pending, failed-to-complete, refused with CaseVersionNotValidError, answered draft, answered released -- and asserts the Edit version link's href is /cases/$slug/versions/$version, keyed to the screen's own path params, on each.",
      "task": "task/draft-editor-correction-while-invalid/route-the-manifest-screen-to-the-version-editor"
    }
